o Trades Cleats for Sneakers, Joins The Citadel Bulldogs Basketball**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 140, "end": 415, "text": "Charleston, SC - In a stunning move that has left fans and pundits alike scratching their heads, Indonesian football sensation Wismoyo Widhistio has announced his decision to trade in his cleats for sneakers, joining the men's college basketball team at The Citadel Bulldogs."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 416, "end": 651, "text": "The 25-year-old Widhistio, who has made a name for himself on the international football stage with his lightning-quick speed and razor-sharp agility, revealed his surprising career shift in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 652, "end": 831, "text": "\"I've always had a passion for basketball, and I felt it was time to challenge myself in a new way,\" Widhistio said, donning a Citadel Bulldogs jersey and flashing a bright smile."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 832, "end": 966, "text": "\"The Citadel's rich history and commitment to excellence resonated with me, and I'm excited to bring my unique skillset to the court.\""}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 967, "end": 1165, "text": "Widhistio's decision has sent shockwaves through the college basketball community, with many wondering how a footballer with no prior basketball experience could make the transition to the hardwood."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1166, "end": 1313, "text": "However, Citadel Bulldogs head coach Duggar Baucom is confident that Widhistio's athleticism and work ethic will translate seamlessly to the court."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1314, "end": 1403, "text": "\"Wismoyo is an incredible athlete, and we're thrilled to have him on board,\" Baucom said."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1